{
  "folder": "twA4EvH7ITGXKuxk",
  "name": "Elemental Miracle",
  "type": "spell",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"Standard\">Your elemental thaumaturgy allows you to wrestle control of an element directly. As part of Casting this Spell, you can attune to a different element. You then bend an element you are attuned with to your whim, h<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">owever, but you can affect elements that are magical, secured in place, or attended by a creature that is unwilling.</span></p><p class=\"Standard\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">This has the following effects, depending on your chosen option:</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\" class=\"Standard\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">·</span></span><span style=\"font:7.0pt 'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">         </span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Create</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You create a 20-foot burst of that element in a targeted space. This behaves very similarly to the Thaumaturgy effect, but creatures in the area must make a basic Reflex save or take 6d6 damage of the type affiliated with the element. Depending on the element chosen, this can create a myriad of lingering effects, such as Earth causing difficult terrain, Fire or Metal causing hazardous terrain, or Water pouring a large amount of water as the effect resolves.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\" class=\"Standard\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">·</span></span><span style=\"font:7.0pt 'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">         </span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Unravel</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You can pull apart an element. An object or creature made up of that element takes 6d6 damage, or you can attempt to counteract a magical effect that shares that element’s trait. A creature made up of an element can make a basic Reflex save, while a creature attending to or wearing an object with that element can make a Reflex save to avoid your effects on a success.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\" class=\"Standard\"><span style=\"mso-list:Ignore\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">·</span></span><span style=\"font:7.0pt 'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-family:'Symbol'\">         </span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Translate</strong></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You can move 4 bulk of an element up to 20 feet in any direction. If you choose this option, this spell has a sustained duration of up to 10 minutes, and you can move large amounts of the element at a time each time you Sustain the spell.</span></p><hr><p><strong>Heighten (+2)</strong> You increase the range of this spell by 15 feet, and the Bulk you can move increases by 2. The damage the spell can deal increases by 2d6.</p>"
    },
